    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/3c4defad433a46f73b5f79445b0b4931.poster.avif?t=1729067001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/3c4defad433a46f73b5f79445b0b4931.webm?t=1729067001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/3c4defad433a46f73b5f79445b0b4931.mp4?t=1729067001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chickado</strong> is a unique game that focuses on the unforgettable and brave revenge struggle of an oppressed and scorned chick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a small chick living on a farm, crushed under the pressure and oppression of other animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will take part in the heroic journey by controlling the chick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character selection feature will allow playing with different chicks with unique features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will prove their strength and develop their character by battling other animals on the farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can make the chick even stronger by acquiring new weapons and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mechanics of directing automatically firing weapons will test tactical skills and quick reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various support tools and turrets will be available to help the character in the fight for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will face enemy waves by choosing among different sections on the farm, developing their strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chickado</strong> offers a unique experience for those who love farm adventures with its extraordinary story, exciting gameplay, and deep mechanics. If you enjoyed games like &quot;<i>Brotato</i>&quot; and &quot;<i>Vampire Survivors</i>&quot; take the step into the adventure of the little chick and join the game now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/c527586fc450e70b942c1bc15eddeb6b.poster.avif?t=1729067001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/c527586fc450e70b942c1bc15eddeb6b.webm?t=1729067001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/c527586fc450e70b942c1bc15eddeb6b.mp4?t=1729067001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/3c4defad433a46f73b5f79445b0b4931.poster.avif?t=1729067001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/3c4defad433a46f73b5f79445b0b4931.webm?t=1729067001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/3c4defad433a46f73b5f79445b0b4931.mp4?t=1729067001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chickado</strong> is a unique game that focuses on the unforgettable and brave revenge struggle of an oppressed and scorned chick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a small chick living on a farm, crushed under the pressure and oppression of other animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will take part in the heroic journey by controlling the chick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character selection feature will allow playing with different chicks with unique features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will prove their strength and develop their character by battling other animals on the farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can make the chick even stronger by acquiring new weapons and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mechanics of directing automatically firing weapons will test tactical skills and quick reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various support tools and turrets will be available to help the character in the fight for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will face enemy waves by choosing among different sections on the farm, developing their strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chickado</strong> offers a unique experience for those who love farm adventures with its extraordinary story, exciting gameplay, and deep mechanics. If you enjoyed games like &quot;<i>Brotato</i>&quot; and &quot;<i>Vampire Survivors</i>&quot; take the step into the adventure of the little chick and join the game now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/c527586fc450e70b942c1bc15eddeb6b.poster.avif?t=1729067001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/c527586fc450e70b942c1bc15eddeb6b.webm?t=1729067001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504660/extras/c527586fc450e70b942c1bc15eddeb6b.mp4?t=1729067001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
